
LOSSY — the shape admits more than the document says, or claims what it did not
  content-type-unstated at /channels/audit/messages/audited
      the message names no contentType and the document no defaultContentType, so its payload is read as JSON
      -> in send audit.{region} Audited
  selector-empty at /channels/audit/messages/audited
      the message fixes no header or payload member, so the entry selects no consumer interaction, and is matched only by its description, 'send audit.{region} Audited'
      -> in send audit.{region} Audited
  selector-empty at /channels/events/messages/avro
      the message fixes no header or payload member, so the entry selects no consumer interaction, and is matched only by its description, 'send events AvroEvent'
      -> in send events AvroEvent
  schema-format-unread at /channels/events/messages/avro/payload
      the payload's schema is written in application/vnd.apache.avro+json;version=1.9.0, which is not read until a content component for it can decode the body; no body is claimed
      -> in send events AvroEvent
  body-not-json at /channels/events/messages/text
      the body is text/plain, and only a JSON body is derived; no body is claimed
      -> in send events TextEvent
  selector-empty at /channels/events/messages/text
      the message fixes no header or payload member, so the entry selects no consumer interaction, and is matched only by its description, 'send events TextEvent'
      -> in send events TextEvent
  selector-empty at /channels/events/messages/untyped
      the message fixes no header or payload member, so the entry selects no consumer interaction, and is matched only by its description, 'send events Untyped'
      -> in send events Untyped
  untyped-schema at /channels/events/messages/untyped
      the message has no payload schema, so no body is claimed
      -> in send events Untyped
  selector-ambiguous at /components/messages/Shipped
      a message that carries what this entry's selector fixes may also be selected by 'send events.copy Shipped', and janus check chooses neither, so its consumers' interactions are not-published
      -> in send events Shipped
  selector-ambiguous at /components/messages/Shipped
      a message that carries what this entry's selector fixes may also be selected by 'send events Shipped', and janus check chooses neither, so its consumers' interactions are not-published
      -> in send events.copy Shipped
  reply-unresolved at /operations/answerLookupNowhere/reply
      the reply names no message, and no channel whose messages it is, so the operation's answers are not derived
  reference-unresolved at /operations/sendMissing/messages/0
      '#/components/messages/Missing' is not in this document, so what it names is not derived
